---Goods containing at least one layer of particle board and one of the following woods (other than plywood):
	(a)	Mandio-queira;
	(b)	Pau amarelo;
	(c)	Quaruba;
	(d)	Tauari

---Goods, as follows:
	(a)	coated or covered with plastics;
